; The binary32 transcendentals as operation sequences: exp, log, sin, cos and
; erf written once over an abstract binary32 arithmetic ([Make]), so that the
; oracle (one instance: [Value]) and every emitter's own instance perform the
; same operations in the same order. Nothing here names a tensor, a program or
; a target. No dependency: it is reachable from every backend, js_of_ocaml and
; Melange included, so no [int] larger than a small constant appears in it.

(library
 (name f32_math))
